{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frights in Tight Spaces sees Agent 11 confront ancient and mysterious forces set on world domination, but this isn't just another day at the office. The Occultists have taken up shop in an abandoned manor house, where lethal traps, ghastly ghouls, and other unspeakable horrors lurk around every corner. Use all of your wits and wiles to survive against a variety of enemies, environmental hazards, and three all-new Bosses.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 New Enemies with terrifying abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 New Levels with nasty surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 New Events that are somewhat perturbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 New Achievements that are NOT SCARY AT ALL<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091260/extras/fff24e35c227d89fdeea63fb5954e3f9.poster.avif?t=1761584167\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091260/extras/fff24e35c227d89fdeea63fb5954e3f9.webm?t=1761584167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091260/extras/fff24e35c227d89fdeea63fb5954e3f9.mp4?t=1761584167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A mysterious and lethal cult obsessed with summoning otherworldly beings and worshipping forgotten gods. They've taken up residence in a haunted manor house, and there's no telling what horrors await.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091260/extras/b30518d64fc0a64d113535f566428523.poster.avif?t=1761584167\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091260/extras/b